{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change","id":35302,"title":"The Demonic Sex Change","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-22T19:39:43-08:00","id":35302,"title":"The Demonic Sex Change","content":"So, my players want to offer a 'sex change' pact to somebody.<br /> <br /> Is it possible to do this? Is it possible to even take 'Male' or 'Female' as a cover aspect simultaniously, so you might turn a female male and have the 'Female' cover fragment?<br /> <br /> Now, further, one might imagine that instant transformation is possible, but what about -retroactive- transformation. IE, not 'I want to be a boy', but 'I want to have been BORN a boy'. Could a Demon make a pact of that nature?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T20:03:19-08:00","id":35313,"title":"","content":"I'd say yes, but that's just me. Also, I'd price it as a 3 Cover Experiences pact \u2014 your physical sex is, whether you identify with it or not, a major part of who you are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T20:07:27-08:00","id":35321,"title":"","content":"Nope, pacts doesn't seem to work retroactively.<br /> <br /> Even if it was possible... Can you imagine the backlash when a third party goes &quot;Wait, he's a woman now?&quot;<br /> <br /> Or maybe have people think the signatory pulled a &quot;<a href=\"https://www.google.com.ar/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=1&amp;cad=rja&amp;ved=0CC8QFjAA&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.imdb.com%2Ftitle%2Ftt0171804%2F&amp;ei=ora3Uoe0EOelsQSY9YDYAg&amp;usg=AFQjCNGBpBSwsCFAOehsntjVfOJXKNQlmA&amp;sig2=QmAT778r9U7x7gLMWqMY5w\" target=\"_blank\">Boys Don't Cry</a>&quot; stunt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T14:43:13-08:00","id":35817,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=35321#post35321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nope, pacts doesn't seem to work retroactively.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the pact section doesn't it outright say that pacts do affect the world around a person to make a pact 'true'? One of the examples even spelled out that if a demon took someones girlfriend as a cover aspect that all evidence of the former relationship would alter itself to reflect that the Demon was now the girls significant other. Even going so far as to say that the girls memories would be altered as well, though admittedly not anyone else unless the pact was packing some extra strength.<br /> <br /> So in this case i'd say the new woman or man to be would discover that all of their records, like birth certificates and family photos, hell even yearbooks, would prove that they've 'always' been a woman/man. Possibly even changing the memories of those closest to him/her to match the new situation. But those who aren't super close wouldn't be affected and may well wonder where their buddy went and why the hell this new person is claiming to be them but gender bent. Which may well be a reason why most Demons may avoid pacting for something so 'large'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1696-redspine","name":"RedSpine","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T22:10:53-08:00","id":36133,"title":"","content":"And yet... official documentation and such, unless the Demon was very low-cover, would go and say &quot;Yeah, this dude's always been a woman&quot;. 99 people out of 100 would just go &quot;Oh, must've looked more feminine/masculine than I'd have expected&quot;. That rare 100th person would go &quot;There's something up here&quot; and dig deeper.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T02:25:26-08:00","id":36257,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MissMaddy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change#post35302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it possible to even take 'Male' or 'Female' as a cover aspect simultaniously, so you might turn a female male and have the 'Female' cover fragment?</div> </div> </div> </div>That contradiction would probably damage your cover significantly. If you manage build a cover strong enough to withstand the damage you'd probably end up with an intersex cover; but it's no where near as effective as buying the intersex from an actual intersex person.<br /> <br /> Or did you mean buying the physical sex of a woman and the gender identity of a man? That's completely valid and reasonably safe, the worst it could do is draw some unwanted attention from your behaviour (and that unwanted attention could be used as a distraction or a better explanation than &quot;a demon in disguise&quot; for any weirdness)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T06:06:33-08:00","id":36322,"title":"","content":"But if you take the gender identity of someone via pact... what happens with their gender identity?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T06:11:14-08:00","id":36326,"title":"","content":"Imagine someone who has no gender identity at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T07:19:01-08:00","id":36363,"title":"","content":"I think the word demonic is kind of problematic in this context","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/275-leaper","name":"Leaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar275_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T09:09:26-08:00","id":36405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=36322#post36322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But if you take the gender identity of someone via pact... what happens with their gender identity?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that they'd both feel freedom from the pressure to be masculine or feminine, but also loose out on a sense of belonging (or a sense of alienation if their gender identity doesn't match how they're perceived by others).<br /> <br /> Depending on who they are that could be a net positive or a net negative. For example, someone with a very strong professional or hobbyist identity might just focus more of their life around that. Someone who relied heavily on their gender identitiy for their self-identity might feel really lost until they find something else to focus their identity around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T08:56:44-08:00","id":37359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MissMaddy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change#post35302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it possible to do this? Is it possible to even take 'Male' or 'Female' as a cover aspect simultaniously, so you might turn a female male and have the 'Female' cover fragment?</div> </div> </div> </div>Off the cuff I'd say yes, of course. &quot;Male&quot; or &quot;Female&quot; are certainly the kinds of identity aspects like &quot;Mechanic&quot;, &quot;Airline Pilot&quot;, or &quot;Brother of Jimmy Wells&quot;. When it's signed over, they're neuter, not flipped to the opposite gender.<br /> <br /> If someone wanted to go FtM, the demon would have to offer someone else's &quot;Male&quot; aspect in trade for their &quot;Female&quot; aspect. Conversely, to go MtF, you'd have to offer someone else's &quot;Female&quot; aspect. In either case, when the Pact is signed, the transitions happen simultaneously without going through &quot;Neuter&quot;, if that matters for whatever reason.<br /> <br /> If they simply didn't want to be &quot;Male&quot; anymore, (No more obvious target for kicking, no more testosterone-fueled issues, no more social pressures relevant to being &quot;Male&quot;), then you could take it no problem. If they didn't want to be &quot;Female&quot; anymore, (No more monthly wanting-to-kill-the-world-and/or-own-uterus, no more pregnancy scares, no more social pressures relevant to being &quot;Female&quot;), then also no problem. In either case, that gender identity is simply _gone_, including the physical/behavioral/hormonal indicators. Additionally, the Cover aspects are +2 or -2 to whatever relevant side, since it's a major thing that affects just the signee, not the world around the signee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T12:17:03-08:00","id":37442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paddon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=37359#post37359\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If someone wanted to go FtM, the demon would have to offer someone else's &quot;Male&quot; aspect in trade for their &quot;Female&quot; aspect. Conversely, to go MtF, you'd have to offer someone else's &quot;Female&quot; aspect. In either case, when the Pact is signed, the transitions happen simultaneously without going through &quot;Neuter&quot;, if that matters for whatever reason.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Demon doesn't offer anything of anyone else's. They offer to take, or if this is the Mortal's request on a pact, they offer to give, and the Universe corrects for things. Maybe a transgender person finally gets the reassignment surgery they've been saving up for thanks to a sudden windfall. Maybe a baby that was supposed to be born male is born female. Either way, the Demon doesn't actually take someone else's physical sex as part of the fulfillment of a pact.<br /> <br /> Think of it like a pact granting Resources. The Demon doesn't go out and ruin someone to give their Mortal Buddy extra resources. The Universe just balances the ledger in some way. Demons are salespeople; the Universe is the accountant who makes sure the books are balanced.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T15:08:54-08:00","id":37523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Grim Lich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=37442#post37442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Demon doesn't offer anything of anyone else's. They offer to take, or if this is the Mortal's request on a pact, they offer to give, and the Universe corrects for things. Maybe a transgender person finally gets the reassignment surgery they've been saving up for thanks to a sudden windfall. Maybe a baby that was supposed to be born male is born female. Either way, the Demon doesn't actually take someone else's physical sex as part of the fulfillment of a pact.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, I mean they're holding someone's aspect of &quot;Male&quot; already, they can offer that to someone who wants to be &quot;Male&quot;. Just like a Demon can transfer a Pact or aspects to other Demons, I don't see a reason they couldn't transfer it to a human, especially as part of a Pact with the target human.<br /> <br /> And before you ask, no, a human wouldn't be able to use a Soul Pact the same way a Demon would, just like a Demon can't use a Mage's Soul Pact to get their Awakened abilities. That's just not how these things work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T19:31:58-08:00","id":37613,"title":"","content":"Who says the demon has to be holding someone else's aspect of &quot;Male&quot; to offer someone else the chance to become male?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T03:42:14-08:00","id":37777,"title":"","content":"I think it was implied that whatever a Pact offers must come from somewhere. A Pact that makes the benefitting party rich does not produce money from nowhere. It redirects existing money to end up in the the hands of the benefitting party, by extension making someone else poorer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T04:22:35-08:00","id":37785,"title":"","content":"Does a pact that makes someone more skilled take those skills away from someone else? I'm not sure if it said so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/746-kunoichi","name":"Kunoichi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar746_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T07:40:09-08:00","id":37852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kunoichi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=37785#post37785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does a pact that makes someone more skilled take those skills away from someone else? I'm not sure if it said so.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's implied, sorta, and do-able. Think of all of the aging seniors in hospice care, think of all of the retiring professionals, trained and honed by decades of experience, looking for apprentices to pass their skill down to before their memory fails.<br /> <br /> Story-hook: It seems the local senior homes have been having a rash of brain-aneurysms and strokes, enough to catch the attention of one of the medically-minded characters. Or, the son of one of the patients/victims swears that it all started happening when that new doctor whose smiles never reached his eyes joined. This just as a new factory/mine opened up, and suddenly all of the high-school dropouts are perfect workers, like bees in a brand new hive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T07:57:14-08:00","id":37865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Grim Lich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=37613#post37613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who says the demon has to be holding someone else's aspect of &quot;Male&quot; to offer someone else the chance to become male?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nothing, but this was if they wanted to be &quot;Male&quot; NOW, as in *poof* You have a penis!<br /> <br /> The Demon could certainly offer to get them the reassignment surgery the signee has wanted (whether by paying for it, having a favor owed to them by the doctor, or by kidnapping the doctor's baby and/or blackmail, or heck, even do it themselves), or whatever else the signee considers &quot;Male&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T09:46:11-08:00","id":37904,"title":"","content":"I dislike that aspect of Demon more than any other. That should be one proposed explanation or mechanism, but not the only one.<br /> <br /> The implication of 'Cosmic Karma' and the Universal Equivalence of the God Machine are, in my mind, clashing themes.<br /> <br /> I prefer to suggest that it is indeed possible that those sort of equivelent exchanges happen (and even that they have occasionally been observed, giving credance to claims that this is 'how it works') but that they cannot or do not account for everything the God Machine does.<br /> <br /> In the end, the amount of energy that is required for the God Machine to give somebody Resources is literally insiginificant to it, just as we... human beings... are more or less insignificant to its Cthonic nature. Perhaps sometimes it does take from A to give to B, but just as often it takes from C, or D, or E, or even more difficult to understand solutions. Sometimes it pilfers from other realities, other timelines, that are not even in the 'frame of reference' that typical nWoD entities operate.<br /> <br /> I find that kind of 'mystery Cthulhu' theme much more engaging than the 'In All Thing, Equivalence' stuff that's been kinda done in lots other media before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T10:11:42-08:00","id":37912,"title":"","content":"I have only skimmed the preview document when it was up, but I think it was implied the agent of delivery is not the God-Machine, but reality itself. The God-Machine is not co-opted when a Pact is signed. The Demon uses his novel connection to make things happen. This might use similar pathways to the ones Embeds, Exploits and occult matrices use, but is still not of the Machine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T10:23:37-08:00","id":37915,"title":"","content":"Regardless, it's achieved with the God Machine's 'methods and technology' (which are explicitly not supernatural). While it's powered by Aether instead of the more traditional mojo, the mechanism is implied to be more-or-less similar even if 'hacked'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T10:40:59-08:00","id":37920,"title":"","content":"I think the main point of the &quot;equivalent exchange&quot; is to explain why Demons cannot simply &quot;fix&quot; the World of Darkness by mystically creating a post-scarcity world. I do not think anything is lost by making some specific exceptions in one's game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T10:55:14-08:00","id":37925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MissMaddy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=37904#post37904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dislike that aspect of Demon more than any other. That should be one proposed explanation or mechanism, but not the only one.<br /> <br /> The implication of 'Cosmic Karma' and the Universal Equivalence of the God Machine are, in my mind, clashing themes.<br /> <br /> I prefer to suggest that it is indeed possible that those sort of equivalent exchanges happen (and even that they have occasionally been observed, giving credence to claims that this is 'how it works') but that they cannot or do not account for everything the God Machine does.<br /> <br /> In the end, the amount of energy that is required for the God Machine to give somebody Resources is literally insignificant to it, just as we... human beings... are more or less insignificant to its Cthonic nature. Perhaps sometimes it does take from A to give to B, but just as often it takes from C, or D, or E, or even more difficult to understand solutions. Sometimes it pilfers from other realities, other timelines, that are not even in the 'frame of reference' that typical nWoD entities operate.<br /> <br /> I find that kind of 'mystery Cthulhu' theme much more engaging than the 'In All Thing, Equivalence' stuff that's been kinda done in lots other media before.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's no reason you can't have &quot;mystery Cthulhu&quot; in your games, or any other kind of explanation, but you did come on here and ask for our spitball ideas. I'm in favor of the &quot;In All Things, Equivalence&quot; stuff simply for the plothooks and being able to draw in NPCs and PCs alike. If your players rewriting reality fits into your story, no worries, run with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T12:57:41-08:00","id":37967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>saibot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=37920#post37920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the main point of the &quot;equivalent exchange&quot; is to explain why Demons cannot simply &quot;fix&quot; the World of Darkness by mystically creating a post-scarcity world. I do not think anything is lost by making some specific exceptions in one's game.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a solid point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T13:41:50-08:00","id":37989,"title":"","content":"At the same time, there's the whole thing ab energy never truly being created or destroyed, merely changing states. Demons have access to a lot of weird ways to move things between states and combinations but I imagine they can also draw in power from outside a conceptual set when they need to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","name":"Nicias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T15:13:21-08:00","id":38027,"title":"","content":"One could also cite other reasons to avoid a post-scarcity paradigm, it occurs to me, based purely upon practical espionage concerns - while you -could- give all sorts of people really swell lives at seemingly no cost, for some reason the God Machine likes the system running the way it is. So if you start being disruptive to that system, by say alleviating more human suffering than you ought to, you're going to have to start choosing between compromising your ideals and exposing yourself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T00:10:49-08:00","id":38183,"title":"","content":"At first i was &quot;No can't change someones physcial gender&quot;,<br /> but then I realised that you can pact to make someone beautiful . (Striking looks).<br /> So a Sex Change Aspect might be possible.<br /> Which would be the equivelent of them having the hormone treatment and operations, except perfect.<br /> Not retroactive, for sure.<br /> <br /> What you could no do it take someone Maleness as the thing the Demon is taking away from the person.<br /> Demon pacts take events.<br /> They take relationships, they take jobs, they take person history and crimes committed.<br /> They also take possessions, eg Heirlooms, family home.<br /> They don't take physical aspects of someones life.<br /> You can't take someones maleness any more than you can take there good looks (Striking Looks Merit),<br /> or there height.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also the deal with when you take a relationship, being applied retroactively is: (<b>see page 291/292 of the preview pdf</b>)<br /> <b>It only applies to the memories and objects belong to the person signing the pact.</b><br /> For example Sara trade a Demon her abusive relationship with her dog (That thing is a mutt, wrecks her stuff, and goes to the toilet outside.), in exchange for Resources.<br /> Depending on the exact terms:<br /> Sara looses all memory of the dog.<br /> All her photo's of the few good times she had with the dog, have changed.<br /> the vets bills are gone, and <b>maybe</b> even the shoes the dog ate are fine.<br /> <br /> But it doesn't change other people.<br /> Sara's parents might be surpised when they come round not to have the dog nearly knock them over.<br /> Sara can explain, that she had it put down.<br /> Sara's chewed up shoes <b>might</b> be fine, but her mothers eaten handbag, that hole is their plain as day.<br /> <br /> Worse, Sara's boyfriend who bought the hound as a gift to her, and who loves the cheeky little guy,<br /> is going to notices he is gone and spot the oddness. And unless Sara (and the demon who made the pact) have a plan to<br /> deal with this, he might investigate, and that might degrade cover.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","name":"oxinabox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T08:37:19-08:00","id":38296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MissMaddy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=37915#post37915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Regardless, it's achieved with the God Machine's 'methods and technology' (which are explicitly not supernatural). While it's powered by Aether instead of the more traditional mojo, the mechanism is implied to be more-or-less similar even if 'hacked'.</div> </div> </div> </div> Actually it's not. The text specifically mentions that Pacts are unique to demons. Angels and the God-Machine are not able to enact them, and all demons somehow are. Though how they have this power if they don't get it from the God Machine is not only left a mystery, it's pointed out as a source of debate among the Unchained.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T11:37:58-08:00","id":38353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>oxinabox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=38183#post38183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But it doesn't change other people.<br /> Sara's parents might be surpised when they come round not to have the dog nearly knock them over.<br /> Sara can explain, that she had it put down.<br /> Sara's chewed up shoes <b>might</b> be fine, but her mothers eaten handbag, that hole is their plain as day.<br /> <br /> Worse, Sara's boyfriend who bought the hound as a gift to her, and who loves the cheeky little guy,<br /> is going to notices he is gone and spot the oddness. And unless Sara (and the demon who made the pact) have a plan to<br /> deal with this, he might investigate, and that might degrade cover.</div> </div> </div> </div>From my reading, this is not correct. The text reads that those 'Directly Affected' by the change DO have memories altered. I would suggest that the dog's original owner/gifter would apply as somebody directly affected by the change ; his memories would need to be shifted in order to explain it, and that counts as 'directly affected' to me. I imagine any other owners of the dog would be likewise altered, or those who had had personal experiences with the dog.<br /> <br /> As for how far this goes, the book seems to imply this is a factor of cover - at some point, the alterations DO fail, and you can find an old dog license or something somewhere. If you have low cover, that's pretty easy to do. With high cover, though, even tangentially related people... who had only the most vague 'direct interaction' with the dog... might be fairly well modified. Likewise, with a very low cover, perhaps the demon might 'forget' to edit even very close associations (like the Sara's boyfriend).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T12:56:13-08:00","id":38389,"title":"","content":"As a quick aside, you just answered your own question about retroactiveness of a sex-change pact. If you gain a new gender identity, it's retroactive to when you'd develop any gender identity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T16:05:05-08:00","id":38472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MissMaddy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=38353#post38353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> From my reading, this is not correct. The text reads that those 'Directly Affected' by the change DO have memories altered. I would suggest that the dog's original owner/gifter would apply as somebody directly affected by the change ; his memories would need to be shifted in order to explain it, and that counts as 'directly affected' to me. I imagine any other owners of the dog would be likewise altered, or those who had had personal experiences with the dog.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I interpreted Directly Affected, to be those directly affected by the Pact.<br /> Ie the parties (demon and Sara), who are signing the pact and benefiting from its affect.<br /> <br /> It could be a bit less &quot;Direct&quot;, after it doesn't say &quot;Only Those Party to the Pact&quot; are affected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1699,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","user":"oxinabox","date":". 12-28-2013, 07:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","name":"oxinabox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T16:31:30-08:00","id":38486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>oxinabox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=38183#post38183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What you could no do it take someone Maleness as the thing the Demon is taking away from the person.<br /> Demon pacts take events.<br /> They take relationships, they take jobs, they take person history and crimes committed.<br /> They also take possessions, eg Heirlooms, family home.<br /> They don't take physical aspects of someones life.<br /> You can't take someones maleness any more than you can take there good looks (Striking Looks Merit),<br /> or there height.</div> </div> </div> </div>I swear I remember one of the editors or writers or developers saying that taking someone's hair color was a perfectly valid thing as a response to someone bringing up the question on the forums. Or maybe it was community consensus in a different thread; not sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T17:57:35-08:00","id":38513,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Grim Lich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=38486#post38486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I swear I remember one of the editors or writers or developers saying that taking someone's hair color was a perfectly valid thing as a response to someone bringing up the question on the forums. Or maybe it was community consensus in a different thread; not sure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm I am trying to find.<br /> <br /> In this thread (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14823-random-demon-questions?p=15055#post15055\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...5055#post15055</a>), a Dev says that Not Having Cancer, is a Benefit to the Mortal (Implying Asset, rather than thing taken away for Cover).<br /> I guess you could trade Not Having Cancer (Asset) for Year Spent in Intensive Medical Care (Cover).<br /> Similarly you could trade Physcial Gender Male/Female (Asset) for long term Social Difficulties (Cover)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","name":"oxinabox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T10:12:02-08:00","id":38778,"title":"","content":"I know this is a nitpick, but &quot;physical gender&quot; is a nonsense phrase. Gender is not a physical thing, it's like saying &quot;physical identity&quot;. If you're talking about a person's biological male or female body parts and functions, that is physical sex.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T10:56:46-08:00","id":41202,"title":"","content":"True, but the physical aspect is a part of gender.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T12:40:41-08:00","id":41245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MissMaddy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/35302-the-demonic-sex-change?p=37904#post37904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dislike that aspect of Demon more than any other. That should be one proposed explanation or mechanism, but not the only one.<br /> <br /> The implication of 'Cosmic Karma' and the Universal Equivalence of the God Machine are, in my mind, clashing themes.<br /> <br /> I prefer to suggest that it is indeed possible that those sort of equivelent exchanges happen (and even that they have occasionally been observed, giving credance to claims that this is 'how it works') but that they cannot or do not account for everything the God Machine does.<br /> <br /> In the end, the amount of energy that is required for the God Machine to give somebody Resources is literally insiginificant to it, just as we... human beings... are more or less insignificant to its Cthonic nature. Perhaps sometimes it does take from A to give to B, but just as often it takes from C, or D, or E, or even more difficult to understand solutions. Sometimes it pilfers from other realities, other timelines, that are not even in the 'frame of reference' that typical nWoD entities operate.<br /> <br /> I find that kind of 'mystery Cthulhu' theme much more engaging than the 'In All Thing, Equivalence' stuff that's been kinda done in lots other media before.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can tell you this: the idea that everything must balance and that granted Benefits come from lost Benefits somewhere else was only one idea. It's not necessarily the <i>only </i>explanation.<br /> <br /> Myself, I like the implications that pacts represent at all. Angels can't make them. All demons can. Maybe it's moving parts and rotating cosmic gears into place in a sort of microcosmic representation of the God-Machine's ability itself. Maybe the reason the Machine specifically demands that angels never betray their mission is because once, an impossibly long time ago, It was an angel who betrayed Its mission....<br /> <br /> Anyway, feel free to go with whatever theories you like for your games, and indeed have clashing theories. As far as I'm concerned, there isn't one correct theory\u2014perhaps multiple contradictory theories are correct, perhaps none of them scratch the surface. Even the Unchained cannot fully understand the vastness of the God-Machine or Its incomprehensible plans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T22:45:14-08:00","id":41528,"title":"","content":"I also dislike the cosmic balance, idea.<br /> It doesn't seem like it would be add much.<br /> If it is true, and the players never notice as it is taken from someone they never meet then what is the point?<br /> If it is true, and the player meet someone they have robbed,... well I don't think it makes for a fun storyline","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","name":"oxinabox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T02:40:49-08:00","id":41593,"title":"","content":"But there you go, if there is cosmic balance and there are people robbed by it somewhere in the world, it leaves all options up to the ST.<br /> <br /> If the ST does not want to bother with such a storyline, the Demon and the robbed never meet. If he feels that such a story would be nice, he can have them meet.<br /> <br /> Saying there is no equivalent exchange just cuts down on possible story hooks (in addition to the problems with internal logic that it would cause which I talked about upthread).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T12:28:55-08:00","id":55609,"title":"","content":"Pacts can alter things retroactively in regards to the Demon specifically (the girlfriend example above, for example), but it doesn't alter things in regards to unrelated &quot;Fourth&quot; parties. PlayerA knows he traded his girlfriend away, DemonB now has said girlfriend, and GirlfriendC now thinks DemonB is her boyfriend instead of PlayerA. However, FatherD will be surprised to note PlayerA is no longer GirlfriendC's boyfriend (though will likely justify it instead of rampaging).<br /> <br /> By that example, if a mortal Male became a Female, her friends would be under no compulsion to believe (s/he) was always a Female, though they may justify it as a mundane sex change operation.<br /> <br /> The real question that should be asked is whether a Demon would actually benefit from making that arrangement, because it's very messy socially. And anything that messy would risk cover exposure or compromise.<br /> <br /> Furthermore, while the book does mention that everything comes from somewhere, it's not really a hard and fast &quot;You can't do this in the game!!!!!!&quot; rule, because the world has potentially untapped resources of all sorts. It seems to me this was added more to explain the Top-level Fundaments of &quot;How it Works&quot;, and as potential localized karmic story-arcs. If you Pact someone for Resources 5, it doesn't -necessarily- mean your next door neighbors suddenly lose 5 dots split between them, it just means that the world appropriates those funds for you instead of redistributing them elsewhere. People die all over the world in droves. Like in Office Space, you take a few floating integers from all those dying folks, and you suddenly have Resources 5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2074-64bitjedi","name":"64bitjedi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T22:58:09-08:00","id":58532,"title":"","content":"Okay mild tangent to original bit of the thread but still related to Demon gender identity weirdness: What happens if a Demon makes a patchwork cover with say from one pact you're the mother of one kid and from another pact you're the father of a different one? I mean other than the cover tearing apart at the seams from the slightest glance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1965-joebobjoe","name":"joebobjoe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T05:58:45-08:00","id":58651,"title":"","content":"You can't be the mother of one kid and the father of another in the same cover. You take &quot;Parent of Kid&quot; as the pact benefit and whatever sex you make your cover into determines if your title is Father of 2 kids or Mother of 2 kids.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1105-hulsmanm","name":"hulsmanm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}